						"created":"2024-06-13T23:23:58.836970+02:00",
						"description":"The Procedural Sci-Fi Metal Greeble Material for Blender 4.1 is designed to bring an unparalleled level of detail and complexity to your science fiction projects. This shader uses advanced procedural techniques to generate intricate greeble patterns, simulating the look of futuristic metallic surfaces with panels, ridges, and other small details. Customizable parameters allow for control over greeble density, metal color, wear, and surface roughness, providing flexibility for various sci-fi environments and models. Perfect for starships, machinery, and high-tech settings, this material enhances your scenes with a realistic and engaging sci-fi aesthetic.",
