						"created":"2025-09-27T15:14:22.023866+02:00",
						"description":"A seamless PBR material featuring futuristic sci-fi metal panels with a clean, industrial design. The surface is composed of modular metallic plates with subtle wear, fine grooves, and mechanical details, giving it a high-tech, engineered appearance. The material has a realistic metallic sheen with carefully balanced roughness, making it suitable for use in spacecraft interiors, control rooms, futuristic architecture, or sci-fi props. Optimized for tileable workflows, it provides consistent detail at any scale without visible seams.",
