					"canDownload":true,
					"canDownloadError":true,
					"category":"metal",
					"created":"2023-11-27T22:38:28.754436+01:00",
					"description":"Explore the raw industrial beauty of Brow Rusted, a distinctive PBR material that captures the essence of aged iron and metal. This 2K texture boasts a captivating blend of browns and rust, providing a realistic representation of weathered surfaces. The material is optimized for physically based rendering (PBR), ensuring authenticity in virtual environments.\r\n\r\nDive into the intricate details with key texture maps:\r\n\r\n- Normal\r\n- Metallic\r\n- Roughness\r\n- Diffuse\r\n\r\nThis versatile PBR material finds its place in a variety of use cases:\r\n\r\n- Industrial environments for an authentic portrayal of weathered structures.\r\n- Gaming environments to add realism and depth to virtual worlds.\r\n- Architectural visualization for a touch of raw, industrial aesthetics.\r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in the possibilities of Brow Rusted; a PBR material that brings the charm of aged iron and metal to your digital creations.",
					"dictParameters":{
						"condition":"new",
						"engine":"cycles",
						"materialStyle":"realistic",
						"megapixels":16,
						"nodeCount":16,
						"pbrType":"metallic",
